{"data":[{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2087036802821722295","created_at":"2026-08-11T04:42:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2087036802821722295"],"id":"2087036802821722295","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1684,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"谁等下带她 -30%，她要开启B计划补仓去了 https://t.co/qNKo9nOuiC","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2087036802821722295"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2087035113607762296","created_at":"2026-08-11T04:35:20.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2087035113607762296"],"id":"2087035113607762296","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":4965,"like_count":1,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"美国法官暂时叫停五角大楼对药明康德“中国军工企业”的认定。药明康德、百济神州上调 2026 全年业绩指引；1-7 月全球前十 BD 授权交易中国药企独占 8 席。国内创新药 License-out 出海持续爆发，大分子、ADC、自免管线成为海外药企收购重点，验证国内研发能力全球认可度提升。","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2087035113607762296"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2087028067466403971","created_at":"2026-08-11T04:07:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2087028067466403971"],"id":"2087028067466403971","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":8,"impression_count":11628,"like_count":11,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2081568507230106105","type":"quoted"}],"text":"复习下功课！什么叫死叉买入，什么叫创新药必走大牛！ https://t.co/Aic7mrriZs https://t.co/CV0lgYTmFO","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2087028067466403971"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2086796455659139431","created_at":"2026-08-10T12:47:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2086796455659139431"],"id":"2086796455659139431","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":1250,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":1},"text":"推理能力强的人拥有\"对终点的预判\"能力：事情未至终点，已知大概率结局。这非神秘预言，而是认知维度的绝对穿透——能同时把握开头、过程、变量与全量。当普通人困于眼前抉择时，他们早已站在终点等待。正因洞悉全局走向，推理强者从不慌乱，心中自有定数。这种能力源于系统性思维，而非直觉猜测。","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2086796455659139431"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2086714185258504701","created_at":"2026-08-10T07:20:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2086714185258504701"],"id":"2086714185258504701","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":67,"impression_count":13881,"like_count":192,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":15,"retweet_count":26},"text":"莫言说：“低级的男人，是不可能给你爱的，也给不出来爱”。爱是高手才拥有的能力，因为爱是一种代价，一种付出，一种非常智慧的东西。\n .\n爱是需要财富，地位，和物质的，帮人提供谋略和战术，给人极致的服饰，给人情绪价值和物质。","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2086714185258504701"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2086639355658182739","created_at":"2026-08-10T02:22:44.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2086639355658182739"],"id":"2086639355658182739","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2369,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"text":"指数3950上方会震荡加剧，大家注意减仓，有能力的多高抛低吸！","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2086639355658182739"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2086611894367105208","created_at":"2026-08-10T00:33:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2086611894367105208"],"id":"2086611894367105208","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":8,"impression_count":2748,"like_count":26,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":1},"text":"爱情并不是一个很强烈的瞬间的感觉，它实际上就是一种人格的表现，换句话说，爱情的本质，并不存在着一个普世皆然固定不变的内涵，它其实是因人而异。正因为有不同的人格，就会有不同的爱情，而人格是可以成长的，是可以提升的，当然也是要在后天逐渐学习而让它加以完善化的，因此爱是必须要学习的。","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2086611894367105208"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2086416265309212900","created_at":"2026-08-09T11:36:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2086416265309212900"],"id":"2086416265309212900","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":11970,"like_count":2,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"不开蓝标能做成10万粉的大号吗，之前有人做到过没？","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2086416265309212900"},{"author_i